lternative to use when cooking or baking. Coconut oil is a naturally rich source of medium chain triglycerides (MCTs), which are quickly absorbed by the body to produce energy. MCTs are hydrolyzed more rapidly and metabolized more completely than long chain fatty acids."}, {"type": "Formulation re: Does NOT Contain", "notes": "Our cold-pressed, organic extra virgin oil is from the Phillippines and is naturally free of trans fat, 100% cholesterol free, contains no hexane and is certified non-GMO."}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "GNC SuperFoods Coconut Oil is highly heat stable, ideal for cooking and makes a delicious, energizing substitute for regular oils, butter or shortening in recipes. Spread on bread or mix into your favorite smoothie. Enjoy the great, refreshing taste of the tropics with GNC SuperFoods Coconut Oil!"}, {"type": "Seals/Symbols", "notes": "Quality Assurance International\nCertified Organic"}, {"type": "Seals/Symbols", "notes": "USDA Organic"}, {"type": "Formulation re: Organic", "notes": "Quality Assurance International\nCertified Organic\nUSDA Organic"}, {"type": "Seals/Symbols", "notes": "OU"}, {"type": "Formula re: Kosher", "notes": "OU"}, {"type": "Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions", "notes": "To Ensure A Complete Nutritional Program, Take Daily With These GNC Products:\nGNC Premium Multivitamin\nUltra Probiotic Complex\nFish Oil"}, {"type": "Formulation re: Organic", "notes": "Certified Organic by QAI & ECOCERT ICO.\n(US-ORG-016)"}, {"type": "Formulation re: Organic", "notes": "Organic extra virgin"}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "Natural source of medium chain triglycerides"}, {"type": "General: Product/Version Code", "notes": "CODE 465614 DQG"}, {"type": "Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions", "notes": "Directions: Enjoy up to three tablespoons of extra virgin coconut oil each day. Ideal as a medium-heat cooking oil (up to 280(0) F), as a nutritious substitute in baking, and a \"better-than-butter\" replacement on bread, vegetables or popcorn. Can also be used as a luscious oil for skin care, hair care and massage."}, {"type": "Formula re: Contains", "notes": "Contains: Tree nuts (Coconut)."}, {"type": "Precautions re: Allergies", "notes": "Contains: Tree nuts (Coconut). Bottled in a facility that produces peanut oil."}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "Not a significant source of dietary fiber, sugar, vitamin A, vitamin C, calcium, or iron."}, {"type": "Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications", "notes": "Warning: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, or have a medical condition."}, {"type": "Precautions re: All Other", "notes": "Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."}, {"type": "Storage", "notes": "This product requires no refrigeration, is solid at room temperature and melts at 76(0) F."}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "Any brown specks present in this product are naturally occuring coconut fibers."}], "targetGroups": ["Adult (18 - 50 Years)", "Kosher", "Organic"], "thumbnail": "", "upcSku": "0 48107 12525 7", "userGroups": [{"dailyValueTargetGroupName": "Adults and children 4 or more years of age", "langualCode": "P0250", "langualCodeDescription": "Adults and Children 4 years and above"}], "_source": "api"}
